-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4;"&gt;周二，第一夫人梅拉尼娅·特朗普在白宫外观看总统按照传统赦免一只火鸡。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; font-style: italic;"&gt;摄影师：亚伦·施瓦茨/彭博社&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;就在选民大声表达对生活成本的担忧三周后，大西洋理事会将这一天称为“关税给予日”。这并不完全是在大型&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/fliUOWvZC0Km5Y4HIBo3A7BGWfFQbrIMGFdz8xuGptJ82wCm5im5j2mnnbCJfqIjYTP6KJNTEiylg11-4UG5CwXDOCUcn0FQsdTE8mfLkSixYOOJ6d7D9IniXaKfFTbIEypMK1sqmUg9QXklNmJppX0HdXGPbFFxrrfugq5__O6O4Gt5IU2i6UTf38zJdMFleniIQuP0C5TFX9rRYYeGtmVJXQbR2QhmzFEocugwrdUEMwnYivZEOBlKHuDOpLyF7dHD2v_S4fdWqfYcFl1TVb-KkPuMABjz7z1cYPlU-p2IT4fjI9d6ByVtvmkdKhMXoz6DS2nDgHCnLaKQ49T3Nnhum9Cv0qjs1d6WLHLnOYbALqobCRaOWwWCAEJfQJxJwpX2uI5k-XJ9lUUj6u_Xu521fHUAEnbv8B-hfBuaPvPk485L4qG9r5j3uvKYxDP82w-Lq9_26i6GKc6sWS6FAkj6duBbFbyMeeimOB2_B2TWxdpPtKPoRqhH7wUG73t8YY4s-oZYsWDLbdPVjRRr4m14WO8UMsUEj6xrUYqTxcAEnw/OZ2Fkg_eQ0hMYF5myspzPv17UDyAxS4u/26" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="警惕通胀的购物者在黑色星期五继续消费"&gt;购物日&lt;/a&gt;之前让消费者兴奋所需要的光学效果。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;美国人距离食品价格上涨的开始比结束还更近。在一系列技术故障吓得公众囤积救生物品后，发电机和卫生纸的价格也在&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/6XKVSbnVsLJJu0axoY5K3sR__-RdL58zhuQjnnjyA84Kz5WHUn4cxYGPxFYwTIzfxNNmbaWhB4378wV3qIw2iBtlMU9J-yVaIadF96PSkUV37t-bnqrICU5esSy2RQqBrY32crkYclxK-WLhdvtBfJJPsg3sxUkgfCmUxxO-jh5i-voZ7PlEOM50lVc8D25sLk4YQXhUlvSCPy1jbqywgWPcIu7p34CZQyhBE0SWGATyozEHXsaVRHmcOj295PG2Zc8cBVdKJpz37bcggMsJuC32QerEqiYp_rCBiyHQMC7bmHwYkgyr_ttq6f1j749BM_6AIUxtqOut9rBxeF-qnDuPOuVNFiQOW72YEi3izpdRZ1Zs1hfvmcqhXJmeh023ZFIs0gCGhDUGYy1rhOKC4LvNs9MZBLLuzz3jNjTLp95JLG7w5yrSBJ1erIZwkvEdLP4GUeGD1xF3IwZwheL4pN9srdLsUQoyXZkWAG1OhvzHXQEdtIk5R6ODcCel4x6cL9PYv1agG2wdWF3ktvZswBaa4V1xpmK1QcREnIRLZlDEhg/0prFpnriDRZR3F4MChVWHjZyTBWzErCN/26" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="由于停电吓坏了美国消费者，燃油必需品价格飙升"&gt;飙升&lt;/a&gt